                <td bgcolor="#f0f0f0" width="20%" valign="top"><b>Status Update:</b></td>
                <td id="customfield_10712-7672731-value" class="value" bgcolor="#ffffff" width="80%">      <p><b>2026 01-07:</b></p>

<p><b><font color="#ffab00">DISCUSS</font></b>: <b>This hazard is reported by SecArch and the related service ticket is <a href="https://jira.oci.oraclecorp.com/browse/ODBX-9563" title="Administrative APIs are accessible over HTTP, leading to the transmission of sensitive data in plaintext, which can be intercepted or manipulated through man-in-the-middle (MITM) attacks" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="ODBX-9563"><del>ODBX-9563</del></a> (also reported by SecArch), due date is *12/30/2025</b> and a security exception has also been filed, approved and expires <b>30/Jan/2026 (SDR-31649)</b>. </p>
  </td>
            </tr>
